  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "安徽取安庆徽州，平安美好；山西简称晋，三晋大地；甘肃取甘州肃州，河西走廊；贵州源于贵山贵水；山东简称鲁，齐鲁大地，礼乐文明，装着民族精神故乡。省名背后，都是历史与心思#中国省名 #省名来历  #贵州 #山东 #中华文化#中华文化1000问",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 434.399002,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了。第十到第六，福建是福州加建州，云南是云岭之南，浙江因钱塘江得名，江苏是江宁加苏州，四川因四条大川得名。好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。有人说山东呢？有人说安徽呢别急，今天这集就是第五道第一，一个比一个震撼。最后那个两两个字里装着一个民族的精神故乡。老规矩，开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁。在听第五名。安徽、安徽这个名字是安庆和徽州各取一个字拼出来的。安庆，南宋时期叫安庆君，意思是平安吉庆。徽州徽字本身就是美好的意思，一个安一个徽安是平安婚，视美好，合在一起平安美好，可您知道吗？安徽简称皖，这个字更有来头晚。在古书里的意思是，黎明时分，古代有一个以澄光为图腾的部落，就叫挽国，一个省的名字，把两个最美好的地名合并，又用一个象征着黎明的字做简称安灰。 Why平安美好晨光三个字三种住院第四名，山西山西这两个字，表面上看是太行山之西，简单直接，可您要是往深了想，山西简称晋，这个字的分量太重了。晋是春秋五霸之一，晋国的晋是三家分晋的晋，是三晋大地的晋山西。这片土地上发生了多少改变中国历史的大事。晋文公称霸赵魏韩，三家分晋，李渊从晋阳起兵，建立唐朝一个晋字，把两千多年的风云全装进去了。山西太行山之西，简称晋三晋大地。表里山河。一个省的名字里，有地理，有历史、有霸业、有兴亡。第三名，甘肃、甘肃的名字是怎么来的？把甘州和宿州各取一个字合在一起，就是甘肃甘州，就是今天的张掖，肃州，就是今天的酒泉。这两座城都在河西走廊上，是古代丝绸之路的必经之地。元朝的时候，朝廷设了甘肃行省，取甘州的甘和肃州的肃拼成了甘肃。可这两个字选的也有讲究，甘是甘甜的意思。张掖这个地方水草丰美，祁连山的雪水灌溉出了大片绿洲，确实甘甜肃是肃穆的意思。酒泉往昔就是戈壁，大漠荒凉肃杀，用素字再合适不过一个甘一个素，一个是绿洲的甘甜，一个是大漠的肃穆两个字，把河西走廊从东到西的风景全概括了。讲了这么多评论区，好多朋友说这些省名的讲究，听着有意思，可咱们这年纪记不住那么多带孙子的时候，想讲讲自己也说不全。前阵子我翻到一本中华文化常识一千问，分门别类，一问一答，把中国历史上的文化常识讲的清清楚楚。这些省名的来历，书里能查到不少，特别适合中老年朋友，每天翻两页，心里全有谱，已经放下面了，点开就能看到。喜欢历史的弄一本放床头，随手翻一页，就是一段历史。第二名，贵州贵州这个名字很多人以为跟贵重有关，其实不是贵州的贵，最早指的是一座山桂山。就在今天，贵阳附近宋朝的时候，朝廷在这一带设了贵州。这个地名。为什么用贵字？因为当地有座桂山，山下有条贵水，先有山有水。再有省明古人取名的规矩就是这样，先找到一个标志性的地理特征，然后用它来命名整片区域。可贵州还有一个说法更有意思。据说当年朝廷给这块地方取名的时候，当地的土司首领说了一句，此地甚贵，意思是这块地方物产丰富。地势险要很金贵，朝廷一听行，那就叫贵州吧。不管是哪个说法，贵，这个字都不是白给的。贵州地处云贵高原山，高林密，矿产丰富，确实当得起一个贵字，一座山叫，贵山一座河，叫贵山，一个省就叫贵州。古人取名先看山水，再定名号。第一，名贵东山东这两个字，表面上是太行山之东，可您知道吗？山东简称鲁，这个字的分量比山西的晋还重。鲁是周公旦的封国，是孔子的故乡，是礼乐文明的发源地。周公治礼作乐，孔子创立儒家，都在鲁国这片土地上，一个鲁字，把中国两千多年的礼乐文明全装进去了。山东太行山之东，简称鲁，齐鲁大地，礼仪之邦。一个省的名字里，有地理、有圣人、有礼乐、有文章。全中国那么多省民，有哪一个能像山东这样两个字里装着一个民族的精神故乡，他就是山东。这个名字的讲究不在字面上，在他背后藏着的那段让所有中国人热血沸腾的故事里，您发现没有？这些省名没有一个是随便起的，福建靠的是福州加建州，云南靠的是云岭之南，浙江靠的是一条江的曲折。江苏靠的是江宁加苏州，四川靠的是四条大船，安徽靠的是安庆加徽州。山西靠的是三晋大地，甘肃靠的是甘州加肃州，贵州靠的是贵山贵水。山东靠的是齐鲁大地，礼仪之邦，每一个省民的讲究都不在字面上在他背后藏着的那段历史那个故事那份心思，点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 710,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00002",
      "start_ms": 990,
      "end_ms": 1810,
      "text": "咱们盘了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1810,
      "end_ms": 3410,
      "text": "第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4050,
      "end_ms": 6470,
      "text": "福建是福州加建州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7030,
      "end_ms": 8810,
      "text": "云南是云岭之南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9490,
      "end_ms": 11750,
      "text": "浙江因钱塘江得名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12190,
      "end_ms": 14210,
      "text": "江苏是江宁加苏州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14730,
      "end_ms": 17130,
      "text": "四川因四条大川得名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00009",
      "start_ms": 17610,
      "end_ms": 19830,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00010",
      "start_ms": 20050,
      "end_ms": 21690,
      "text": "有人说山东呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21730,
      "end_ms": 23730,
      "text": "有人说安徽呢别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00012",
      "start_ms": 24630,
      "end_ms": 27030,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00013",
      "start_ms": 27330,
      "end_ms": 28590,
      "text": "一个比一个震撼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00014",
      "start_ms": 28750,
      "end_ms": 32920,
      "text": "最后那个两两个字里装着一个民族的精神故乡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33600,
      "end_ms": 34300,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00016",
      "start_ms": 34480,
      "end_ms": 35380,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00017",
      "start_ms": 35760,
      "end_ms": 37760,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00018",
      "start_ms": 37920,
      "end_ms": 39200,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00019",
      "start_ms": 39200,
      "end_ms": 40880,
      "text": "在听第五名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00020",
      "start_ms": 41220,
      "end_ms": 47460,
      "text": "安徽、安徽这个名字是安庆和徽州各取一个字拼出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00021",
      "start_ms": 48180,
      "end_ms": 48720,
      "text": "安庆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00022",
      "start_ms": 49080,
      "end_ms": 50880,
      "text": "南宋时期叫安庆君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00023",
      "start_ms": 51600,
      "end_ms": 53200,
      "text": "意思是平安吉庆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00024",
      "start_ms": 53640,
      "end_ms": 56500,
      "text": "徽州徽字本身就是美好的意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00025",
      "start_ms": 57160,
      "end_ms": 60570,
      "text": "一个安一个徽安是平安婚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00026",
      "start_ms": 60570,
      "end_ms": 61210,
      "text": "视美好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00027",
      "start_ms": 61390,
      "end_ms": 63625,
      "text": "合在一起平安美好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00028",
      "start_ms": 63970,
      "end_ms": 64875,
      "text": "可您知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00029",
      "start_ms": 65160,
      "end_ms": 66845,
      "text": "安徽简称皖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00030",
      "start_ms": 67540,
      "end_ms": 69890,
      "text": "这个字更有来头晚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00031",
      "start_ms": 69970,
      "end_ms": 71310,
      "text": "在古书里的意思是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00032",
      "start_ms": 71310,
      "end_ms": 72215,
      "text": "黎明时分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00033",
      "start_ms": 72670,
      "end_ms": 75570,
      "text": "古代有一个以澄光为图腾的部落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00034",
      "start_ms": 75570,
      "end_ms": 76595,
      "text": "就叫挽国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00035",
      "start_ms": 77090,
      "end_ms": 78235,
      "text": "一个省的名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00036",
      "start_ms": 78550,
      "end_ms": 80705,
      "text": "把两个最美好的地名合并，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00037",
      "start_ms": 81210,
      "end_ms": 86085,
      "text": "又用一个象征着黎明的字做简称安灰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00038",
      "start_ms": 86450,
      "end_ms": 92125,
      "text": " Why平安美好晨光三个字三种住院第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00039",
      "start_ms": 92550,
      "end_ms": 95545,
      "text": "山西山西这两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00040",
      "start_ms": 95960,
      "end_ms": 98645,
      "text": "表面上看是太行山之西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00041",
      "start_ms": 99340,
      "end_ms": 100435,
      "text": "简单直接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00042",
      "start_ms": 101020,
      "end_ms": 102495,
      "text": "可您要是往深了想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00043",
      "start_ms": 102860,
      "end_ms": 104120,
      "text": "山西简称晋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00044",
      "start_ms": 104400,
      "end_ms": 105905,
      "text": "这个字的分量太重了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00045",
      "start_ms": 106370,
      "end_ms": 108350,
      "text": "晋是春秋五霸之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00046",
      "start_ms": 108350,
      "end_ms": 111455,
      "text": "晋国的晋是三家分晋的晋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00047",
      "start_ms": 111880,
      "end_ms": 114430,
      "text": "是三晋大地的晋山西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00048",
      "start_ms": 114430,
      "end_ms": 119185,
      "text": "这片土地上发生了多少改变中国历史的大事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00049",
      "start_ms": 119890,
      "end_ms": 122330,
      "text": "晋文公称霸赵魏韩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00050",
      "start_ms": 122530,
      "end_ms": 123530,
      "text": "三家分晋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00051",
      "start_ms": 124170,
      "end_ms": 125870,
      "text": "李渊从晋阳起兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00052",
      "start_ms": 126150,
      "end_ms": 127950,
      "text": "建立唐朝一个晋字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00053",
      "start_ms": 128270,
      "end_ms": 131350,
      "text": "把两千多年的风云全装进去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00054",
      "start_ms": 131350,
      "end_ms": 133390,
      "text": "山西太行山之西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00055",
      "start_ms": 133730,
      "end_ms": 136210,
      "text": "简称晋三晋大地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00056",
      "start_ms": 136990,
      "end_ms": 138010,
      "text": "表里山河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00057",
      "start_ms": 138990,
      "end_ms": 140410,
      "text": "一个省的名字里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00058",
      "start_ms": 140670,
      "end_ms": 141530,
      "text": "有地理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00059",
      "start_ms": 141950,
      "end_ms": 145370,
      "text": "有历史、有霸业、有兴亡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00060",
      "start_ms": 145610,
      "end_ms": 146210,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00061",
      "start_ms": 147210,
      "end_ms": 150720,
      "text": "甘肃、甘肃的名字是怎么来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00062",
      "start_ms": 151140,
      "end_ms": 154620,
      "text": "把甘州和宿州各取一个字合在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00063",
      "start_ms": 154700,
      "end_ms": 156120,
      "text": "就是甘肃甘州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00064",
      "start_ms": 156120,
      "end_ms": 157480,
      "text": "就是今天的张掖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00065",
      "start_ms": 158180,
      "end_ms": 158740,
      "text": "肃州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00066",
      "start_ms": 158900,
      "end_ms": 160120,
      "text": "就是今天的酒泉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00067",
      "start_ms": 161060,
      "end_ms": 163180,
      "text": "这两座城都在河西走廊上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00068",
      "start_ms": 163500,
      "end_ms": 166280,
      "text": "是古代丝绸之路的必经之地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00069",
      "start_ms": 167140,
      "end_ms": 168200,
      "text": "元朝的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00070",
      "start_ms": 168320,
      "end_ms": 170180,
      "text": "朝廷设了甘肃行省，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00071",
      "start_ms": 170640,
      "end_ms": 174180,
      "text": "取甘州的甘和肃州的肃拼成了甘肃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00072",
      "start_ms": 174960,
      "end_ms": 177000,
      "text": "可这两个字选的也有讲究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00073",
      "start_ms": 177660,
      "end_ms": 179425,
      "text": "甘是甘甜的意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00074",
      "start_ms": 179850,
      "end_ms": 181775,
      "text": "张掖这个地方水草丰美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00075",
      "start_ms": 182120,
      "end_ms": 185455,
      "text": "祁连山的雪水灌溉出了大片绿洲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00076",
      "start_ms": 186110,
      "end_ms": 189315,
      "text": "确实甘甜肃是肃穆的意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00077",
      "start_ms": 189760,
      "end_ms": 191660,
      "text": "酒泉往昔就是戈壁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00078",
      "start_ms": 191660,
      "end_ms": 193600,
      "text": "大漠荒凉肃杀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00079",
      "start_ms": 193660,
      "end_ms": 197990,
      "text": "用素字再合适不过一个甘一个素，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00080",
      "start_ms": 198230,
      "end_ms": 199745,
      "text": "一个是绿洲的甘甜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00081",
      "start_ms": 200140,
      "end_ms": 203000,
      "text": "一个是大漠的肃穆两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00082",
      "start_ms": 203080,
      "end_ms": 207635,
      "text": "把河西走廊从东到西的风景全概括了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00083",
      "start_ms": 208060,
      "end_ms": 209460,
      "text": "讲了这么多评论区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00084",
      "start_ms": 209460,
      "end_ms": 211860,
      "text": "好多朋友说这些省名的讲究，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00085",
      "start_ms": 212120,
      "end_ms": 213115,
      "text": "听着有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00086",
      "start_ms": 213440,
      "end_ms": 216920,
      "text": "可咱们这年纪记不住那么多带孙子的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00087",
      "start_ms": 216920,
      "end_ms": 218755,
      "text": "想讲讲自己也说不全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00088",
      "start_ms": 219370,
      "end_ms": 222325,
      "text": "前阵子我翻到一本中华文化常识一千问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00089",
      "start_ms": 222770,
      "end_ms": 223730,
      "text": "分门别类，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00090",
      "start_ms": 223930,
      "end_ms": 224945,
      "text": "一问一答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00091",
      "start_ms": 225320,
      "end_ms": 228380,
      "text": "把中国历史上的文化常识讲的清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00092",
      "start_ms": 228520,
      "end_ms": 229880,
      "text": "这些省名的来历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00093",
      "start_ms": 230140,
      "end_ms": 231535,
      "text": "书里能查到不少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00094",
      "start_ms": 232110,
      "end_ms": 234155,
      "text": "特别适合中老年朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00095",
      "start_ms": 234550,
      "end_ms": 235690,
      "text": "每天翻两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00096",
      "start_ms": 235910,
      "end_ms": 237055,
      "text": "心里全有谱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00097",
      "start_ms": 237420,
      "end_ms": 238455,
      "text": "已经放下面了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00098",
      "start_ms": 238810,
      "end_ms": 240115,
      "text": "点开就能看到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00099",
      "start_ms": 240900,
      "end_ms": 242965,
      "text": "喜欢历史的弄一本放床头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00100",
      "start_ms": 243480,
      "end_ms": 244620,
      "text": "随手翻一页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00101",
      "start_ms": 244760,
      "end_ms": 245805,
      "text": "就是一段历史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00102",
      "start_ms": 246080,
      "end_ms": 246645,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00103",
      "start_ms": 247000,
      "end_ms": 250190,
      "text": "贵州贵州这个名字很多人以为跟贵重有关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00104",
      "start_ms": 250350,
      "end_ms": 252825,
      "text": "其实不是贵州的贵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00105",
      "start_ms": 253100,
      "end_ms": 255530,
      "text": "最早指的是一座山桂山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00106",
      "start_ms": 255550,
      "end_ms": 256390,
      "text": "就在今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00107",
      "start_ms": 256510,
      "end_ms": 259030,
      "text": "贵阳附近宋朝的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00108",
      "start_ms": 259030,
      "end_ms": 261495,
      "text": "朝廷在这一带设了贵州。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00109",
      "start_ms": 261810,
      "end_ms": 262445,
      "text": "这个地名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00110",
      "start_ms": 262690,
      "end_ms": 263775,
      "text": "为什么用贵字？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00111",
      "start_ms": 264210,
      "end_ms": 265835,
      "text": "因为当地有座桂山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00112",
      "start_ms": 266250,
      "end_ms": 267735,
      "text": "山下有条贵水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00113",
      "start_ms": 268370,
      "end_ms": 269625,
      "text": "先有山有水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00114",
      "start_ms": 270000,
      "end_ms": 273725,
      "text": "再有省明古人取名的规矩就是这样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00115",
      "start_ms": 274550,
      "end_ms": 277005,
      "text": "先找到一个标志性的地理特征，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00116",
      "start_ms": 277590,
      "end_ms": 280105,
      "text": "然后用它来命名整片区域。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00117",
      "start_ms": 280950,
      "end_ms": 282895,
      "text": "可贵州还有一个说法更有意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00118",
      "start_ms": 283810,
      "end_ms": 287255,
      "text": "据说当年朝廷给这块地方取名的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00119",
      "start_ms": 287800,
      "end_ms": 289720,
      "text": "当地的土司首领说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00120",
      "start_ms": 289720,
      "end_ms": 290585,
      "text": "此地甚贵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00121",
      "start_ms": 291190,
      "end_ms": 293675,
      "text": "意思是这块地方物产丰富。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00122",
      "start_ms": 294300,
      "end_ms": 296440,
      "text": "地势险要很金贵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00123",
      "start_ms": 296980,
      "end_ms": 298260,
      "text": "朝廷一听行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00124",
      "start_ms": 298300,
      "end_ms": 299320,
      "text": "那就叫贵州吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00125",
      "start_ms": 299360,
      "end_ms": 300580,
      "text": "不管是哪个说法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00126",
      "start_ms": 300820,
      "end_ms": 301060,
      "text": "贵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00127",
      "start_ms": 301140,
      "end_ms": 302840,
      "text": "这个字都不是白给的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00128",
      "start_ms": 303640,
      "end_ms": 306360,
      "text": "贵州地处云贵高原山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00129",
      "start_ms": 306440,
      "end_ms": 307160,
      "text": "高林密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00130",
      "start_ms": 307420,
      "end_ms": 308460,
      "text": "矿产丰富，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00131",
      "start_ms": 308780,
      "end_ms": 311040,
      "text": "确实当得起一个贵字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00132",
      "start_ms": 311880,
      "end_ms": 312980,
      "text": "一座山叫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00133",
      "start_ms": 313080,
      "end_ms": 314700,
      "text": "贵山一座河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00134",
      "start_ms": 314700,
      "end_ms": 315420,
      "text": "叫贵山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00135",
      "start_ms": 315780,
      "end_ms": 317140,
      "text": "一个省就叫贵州。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00136",
      "start_ms": 317860,
      "end_ms": 320380,
      "text": "古人取名先看山水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00137",
      "start_ms": 320700,
      "end_ms": 321700,
      "text": "再定名号。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00138",
      "start_ms": 322060,
      "end_ms": 322420,
      "text": "第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00139",
      "start_ms": 322420,
      "end_ms": 325430,
      "text": "名贵东山东这两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00140",
      "start_ms": 325790,
      "end_ms": 327950,
      "text": "表面上是太行山之东，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00141",
      "start_ms": 328650,
      "end_ms": 329570,
      "text": "可您知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00142",
      "start_ms": 329870,
      "end_ms": 331610,
      "text": "山东简称鲁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00143",
      "start_ms": 332450,
      "end_ms": 335670,
      "text": "这个字的分量比山西的晋还重。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00144",
      "start_ms": 336550,
      "end_ms": 338910,
      "text": "鲁是周公旦的封国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00145",
      "start_ms": 339230,
      "end_ms": 340510,
      "text": "是孔子的故乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00146",
      "start_ms": 340710,
      "end_ms": 342790,
      "text": "是礼乐文明的发源地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00147",
      "start_ms": 343610,
      "end_ms": 345010,
      "text": "周公治礼作乐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00148",
      "start_ms": 345250,
      "end_ms": 346630,
      "text": "孔子创立儒家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00149",
      "start_ms": 346850,
      "end_ms": 348770,
      "text": "都在鲁国这片土地上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00150",
      "start_ms": 349590,
      "end_ms": 350450,
      "text": "一个鲁字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00151",
      "start_ms": 350810,
      "end_ms": 355095,
      "text": "把中国两千多年的礼乐文明全装进去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00152",
      "start_ms": 355490,
      "end_ms": 357450,
      "text": "山东太行山之东，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00153",
      "start_ms": 357590,
      "end_ms": 358535,
      "text": "简称鲁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00154",
      "start_ms": 359080,
      "end_ms": 360055,
      "text": "齐鲁大地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00155",
      "start_ms": 360440,
      "end_ms": 361325,
      "text": "礼仪之邦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00156",
      "start_ms": 361990,
      "end_ms": 363295,
      "text": "一个省的名字里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00157",
      "start_ms": 363590,
      "end_ms": 367545,
      "text": "有地理、有圣人、有礼乐、有文章。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00158",
      "start_ms": 368170,
      "end_ms": 369995,
      "text": "全中国那么多省民，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00159",
      "start_ms": 370570,
      "end_ms": 377085,
      "text": "有哪一个能像山东这样两个字里装着一个民族的精神故乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00160",
      "start_ms": 377560,
      "end_ms": 378775,
      "text": "他就是山东。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00161",
      "start_ms": 379240,
      "end_ms": 381500,
      "text": "这个名字的讲究不在字面上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00162",
      "start_ms": 381700,
      "end_ms": 387085,
      "text": "在他背后藏着的那段让所有中国人热血沸腾的故事里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00163",
      "start_ms": 387310,
      "end_ms": 388065,
      "text": "您发现没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00164",
      "start_ms": 388930,
      "end_ms": 392305,
      "text": "这些省名没有一个是随便起的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00165",
      "start_ms": 393160,
      "end_ms": 395465,
      "text": "福建靠的是福州加建州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00166",
      "start_ms": 396040,
      "end_ms": 397965,
      "text": "云南靠的是云岭之南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00167",
      "start_ms": 398390,
      "end_ms": 401015,
      "text": "浙江靠的是一条江的曲折。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00168",
      "start_ms": 401650,
      "end_ms": 404345,
      "text": "江苏靠的是江宁加苏州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00169",
      "start_ms": 404780,
      "end_ms": 406865,
      "text": "四川靠的是四条大船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00170",
      "start_ms": 407260,
      "end_ms": 409765,
      "text": "安徽靠的是安庆加徽州。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00171",
      "start_ms": 410370,
      "end_ms": 412425,
      "text": "山西靠的是三晋大地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00172",
      "start_ms": 412930,
      "end_ms": 415175,
      "text": "甘肃靠的是甘州加肃州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00173",
      "start_ms": 415630,
      "end_ms": 418115,
      "text": "贵州靠的是贵山贵水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00174",
      "start_ms": 418600,
      "end_ms": 420780,
      "text": "山东靠的是齐鲁大地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00175",
      "start_ms": 420860,
      "end_ms": 421805,
      "text": "礼仪之邦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00176",
      "start_ms": 422160,
      "end_ms": 430455,
      "text": "每一个省民的讲究都不在字面上在他背后藏着的那段历史那个故事那份心思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00177",
      "start_ms": 431610,
      "end_ms": 432405,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21fb6a2ddb3553d0_s00178",
      "start_ms": 432740,
      "end_ms": 434275,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
